  "llms": "Dispatch of network-line-graph-edge-vectors\n\n- invocations: 1,280\n- workgroups 5\n- lanes per workgroup 256\n- Lane grid rasterized; first 15 and pinned lane labelled\n- idle lanes 81\n- expanded workgroup 0\n- id probe not recorded\n- timestamps disabled compute-pass coalescing, so passes differ from production\n- 1 observation tap inserted\n- lens twin: transients lineOffsets, lineNeighbors, lineWeights, arcCount, overflow retained instead of aliased\n\nProvenance: structure metadata only.\nAdapter: apple (unknown).",
